# Fire Team ships POSIX shell scripts that must keep LF endings on every
# platform. A CR in a shebang produces "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env^M", so a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true would break every script in the
# bundle. Pin the whole tree to LF and let the .ps1 wrapper keep CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh  text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
